<div class="glass-container">
<h1>Welcome!</h1>
<p>The purpose of this website is to share AI generated memes based on the tv show House M.D.</p>
<p>Each meme was created using Google Gemini.</p>
<p>I have ranked each meme based on relevancy to the show, how accurate Gemini was with generation, and how funny I found them.</p>
<p>Ratings are based on a scale of 1 to 10.</p>
<p> 10 being the highest possible score, 1 being the lowest. </p>
</div>

{% for post in collections.posts %}
  {% if post.data.featured %}
    <div class="featured-post" style="margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-teal); background: rgba(0, 102, 204, 0.05); border-radius: 8px;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: var(--accent-teal);">✨ Featured Post ✨</h2>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--accent-blue);">Read More →</a>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
 
